OL,3,GNEWSACouncil backs exploring asylum
OL,4,Ahousing referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has backed a motion to
OL,7,Fexplore holding an advisory referendum
OL,8,Fover housing asylum seekers in the area
OL,9,Fat the next elections on 6 May 2027.
OL,11,FAt a full Suffolk County Council
OL,12,Fmeeting on Thursday, out of 70
OL,13,Fcouncillors, 39 voted in favour of the
OL,14,Fproposal, with 13 voting against and 13
OL,15,Fabstentions.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
